   $q$Which character in Text 2 matches Suri's role in Text 1?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The lead actor, who freezes in the middle of a line.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-character"},{"text":"The director, who raises a glass at the cast party.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-character"},{"text":"Mateo, the stage crew member who calls each cue from the dark.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The orchestra, which loses its place when the sound fails.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-character"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Mateo, the stage crew member who calls each cue from the dark.$q$, $q$Suri and Mateo are both unnoticed contributors who keep everyone on track during a crisis. The lead actor is like the loud drummers who lose their place, not like Suri.$q$, 'draft', 'cc3fe6f9-1c9a-5c29-801d-7ab56ebf3685')
